    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to make your own arena fighter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s the heart of Fighters Forge\u2014a vision-driven platform where players can engage in fast-paced 3D battles and help shape the future of fighter creation. We\u2019re building a space not just to fight, but to forge your ideal combat experience. Inspired by tools like Mugen, the classic Fighter Maker, and modern successors like Smack Studio, Fighters Forge aims to be the first arena fighter creation engine\u2014a system for crafting, combining, and customizing fighters in a fully 3D battlefield. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s Playable Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coop Arcade / Beat'em Up Mode (inspired by Fighting Force &amp; Dynamite Cop) - 5 Stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/d2aef7780d3af7fa174df2388a0c2d24.avif?t=1754453525\" width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus Mode\u00a0(inspired by Power Stone 2 &amp; Marvel Nemesis) - 5 Stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/45a5884c012b11dacbf37c4890e32c5b.avif?t=1754453525\" width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Combat System:</strong> Team battles and free-for-alls with working 3D rules of engagement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Foundational Movesets:</strong> Every fighter follows a base set of mechanics that establish clarity and balance. - <strong>8 Fighting Styles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Character Select Screen:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allowing players to mix-and-match their fighter's avatar, costume, fighting-style, &amp; elemental superpower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/db8868edbbbc9fbc48ea7230edcbe173.avif?t=1754453525\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting style determines normal attacks and two special moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Element determines two special moves &amp; the ultra attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle Player/CPU/Off for each fighter. Also select team color to determine FFA, 2v2, 1v3, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/3cb66f7dacefd0288979f1103e6e9cdd.avif?t=1754453525\" data-has-big width=800 height=618 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Player Local Multiplayer (Online Support via Steam Remote Play Together)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light attack chains. Heavy attacks are chargeable to launch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block, Parry, &amp; Parry Reversal Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grabs, Techs, &amp; Breaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bursts, Trigger Mode, &amp; Ultra attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons/Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tossing &amp; Catching Props </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Destruction</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Weapons/Items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistol (Golden, Revolver Variations) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword (Pipe, Crowbar Variations) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baseball Bat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket Launcher  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mod Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your Fighters with ReadyPlayerMe custom avatars support. Ensure online connectivity &amp; press R on Character Select Screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/6e5bca67740ef46ead5f1b0090a083ef.avif?t=1754453525\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/12c859c4a7c2daa737de0c95ea46297b.avif?t=1754453525\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom FBX character models are also supported and must be rigged to a Mixamo skeleton in a T-Pose.\u00a0Detailed instructions to be provided soon in the Chaotix Discord server. <br><br>Stage Builder is currently in Development.<br><br>(formerly known as 'Urban Warriors')</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to make your own arena fighter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s the heart of Fighters Forge\u2014a vision-driven platform where players can engage in fast-paced 3D battles and help shape the future of fighter creation. We\u2019re building a space not just to fight, but to forge your ideal combat experience. Inspired by tools like Mugen, the classic Fighter Maker, and modern successors like Smack Studio, Fighters Forge aims to be the first arena fighter creation engine\u2014a system for crafting, combining, and customizing fighters in a fully 3D battlefield. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s Playable Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coop Arcade / Beat'em Up Mode (inspired by Fighting Force &amp; Dynamite Cop) - 5 Stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/d2aef7780d3af7fa174df2388a0c2d24.avif?t=1754453525\" width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus Mode\u00a0(inspired by Power Stone 2 &amp; Marvel Nemesis) - 5 Stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/45a5884c012b11dacbf37c4890e32c5b.avif?t=1754453525\" width=800 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Combat System:</strong> Team battles and free-for-alls with working 3D rules of engagement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Foundational Movesets:</strong> Every fighter follows a base set of mechanics that establish clarity and balance. - <strong>8 Fighting Styles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Character Select Screen:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allowing players to mix-and-match their fighter's avatar, costume, fighting-style, &amp; elemental superpower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/db8868edbbbc9fbc48ea7230edcbe173.avif?t=1754453525\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting style determines normal attacks and two special moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Element determines two special moves &amp; the ultra attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle Player/CPU/Off for each fighter. Also select team color to determine FFA, 2v2, 1v3, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/3cb66f7dacefd0288979f1103e6e9cdd.avif?t=1754453525\" data-has-big width=800 height=618 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Player Local Multiplayer (Online Support via Steam Remote Play Together)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light attack chains. Heavy attacks are chargeable to launch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block, Parry, &amp; Parry Reversal Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grabs, Techs, &amp; Breaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bursts, Trigger Mode, &amp; Ultra attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons/Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tossing &amp; Catching Props </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Destruction</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Weapons/Items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistol (Golden, Revolver Variations) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword (Pipe, Crowbar Variations) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baseball Bat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket Launcher  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mod Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your Fighters with ReadyPlayerMe custom avatars support. Ensure online connectivity &amp; press R on Character Select Screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/6e5bca67740ef46ead5f1b0090a083ef.avif?t=1754453525\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/12c859c4a7c2daa737de0c95ea46297b.avif?t=1754453525\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom FBX character models are also supported and must be rigged to a Mixamo skeleton in a T-Pose.\u00a0Detailed instructions to be provided soon in the Chaotix Discord server. <br><br>Stage Builder is currently in Development.<br><br>(formerly known as 'Urban Warriors')</p>",
    "short_description": "A 3D arena combat sandbox where you fight now and forge what\u2019s next. Customize your fighter's avatar, fighting-style, &amp; elemental superpower then battle it out in explosive matches built for chaos, strategy, and pure fun\u2014solo, co-op, or competitive.",
